        {
          "page": 2,
          "text_chars": 723,
          "text_preview": "Learning objective 1, Key words: peach, taste, wonderful, enjoy, festival, important, invite, terrible, angry, branch, delicious 2,   Key   sentences: Time went by, and Wukong enjoyed his life in Heav",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 3,
          "text_chars": 143,
          "text_preview": "Warm up Have you ever been to a peach garden?  What can we do in a peach garden?                           What Wukong did in the peach garden?   ",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 4,
          "text_chars": 126,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : 1. What can you see in the pictures? What’s the difference? 2. Can you guess what happened in the peach garden?",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 5,
          "text_chars": 101,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : What were Wukong doing?                     How do you think about Wukong’s behavior ?",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 6,
          "text_chars": 207,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : What the Queen asked the maidens to do ?                 What do you know about the Peach Festival? Can you tell me some other kinds of festivals in China? Which festival do you like",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 7,
          "text_chars": 165,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : 1. What did the two maidens see in the peach garden? 2. Why Wukong was angry? What would he want to do? 3. Did Wukong know he was making a big trouble?",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 8,
          "text_chars": 156,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : 1. Why the Guanyin came to the Heaven?  2. Where the Guanyin lived? 3. What was the Guanyin’s magic?  4. Do you think Guanyin is powerful? Why?",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 9,
          "text_chars": 163,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : 1. What happened when the Queen and the Jade Emperor got the news that Wukong ate all the peaches? 2.  Why the Jade Emperor  and the Queen startled?",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 10,
          "text_chars": 134,
          "text_preview": "Free talk 1,Do you like this story?  Why ？ 2,Which character do you like most? Why? 3,Do   you   know   any   other  troubles Wukong made in Heaven ?",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 11,
          "text_chars": 136,
          "text_preview": "Free talk Tips : What can you see in these pictures? Did you make your parents angry? For what? What would you do if you make a big trouble?",
